From a368d7aaf54b08de55cf35929c7e1d993c5cd75f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 05:31:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(od-sevev): envelope flap on every sheet modal, the
 glue rule, O3 hemicycle

- Overlay.make_envelope: sheet_modal_body + sheet_modal_flap, f0/f1/f2 at 0/40/80 ms, title and close from f2, reduced motion f2 at once (review U1, style guide 17.2); SheetCard and FlashCard HEADER_H 96
- Bidi.glue (mobile-first 5.2.1): NBSP inside currency, punctuation and magnitude units, in wrapping PxText and Ticker.paginate, with the weak-joint fallback (U16)
- ElectionCard: the 120-seat hemicycle at x4 as O3's hero, effective seats RTL, left out when the card exceeds the modal band; odModal.hemicycle (5.14.1)
- tests: test_glue, the flap and hemicycle in test_modals

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ6f2h5tcXVKGAwuAga5z8
